    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2497" root="بزو" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَزْوٌ</span></b>  The <i>equal, equivalent,</i> or <i>like,</i> of a thing.
(S, K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَذْتُ مِنْهُ بَزْوَ كَذَا</span> [<i>I took
from him,</i> or <i>of it, the equal, equivalent,</i> or <i>like,
of such a thing</i>]. (S.)

